<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Would’st thou see life work in others,</l><l>Thou thyself must die.</l><l>Fall into the ground, be buried,</l><l>Low in darkness lie.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>But He leaves thee not in darkness,</l><l>Light shall greet thine eyes,</l><l>And in glad new life and glory</l><l>He shall bid thee rise.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Dost thou crave to tread the pathway</l><l>And His life to share?</l><l>As thou passest thru death’s gateway</l><l>He will meet thee there.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Thou shalt learn the blessed secret,</l><l>He shall live that dies;</l><l>From a life poured out in secret</l><l>Shall a harvest rise.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
